  "notes": "Indiana County Republicans elect two 'County Committee' members per precinct (vote for 2, four-year term) in the 2026 primary; seats are not split by sex. 'filled' = a named ballot candidate received votes (one precinct, White #2, had three candidates for two seats; the top two are counted). Seats beyond the number of ballot candidates are 'unknown' when any write-in votes were cast (the report lists individual write-in names, often with 1-2 votes and ties, and does not say whether any write-in winner met legal thresholds or accepted), and 'empty' when no write-in votes were cast. Appointments after the primary are not reflected."
